@Payroll.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5092

### Create an employee
POST {{Payroll.API_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "hourlyRate": 25.50
}
### Submit a timesheet (replace employeeId with the ID from above)
POST {{Payroll.API_HostAddress}}/api/timesheets
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "employeeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "workDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00Z",
  "hoursWorked": 8
}